{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34300","headline":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 乌龙养和 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 乌龙养和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养和名字好，偏寄道情深。\n所以亲逋客，兼能助五禽。\n倚肩沧海望，钩膝白云吟。\n不是逍遥侣，谁知世外心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}